 "description": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Sobre a posi&ccedil;&atilde;o:</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Oportunidade para Advogado(a) em Contencioso C&iacute;vel, com experi&ecirc;ncia em Sa&uacute;de Suplementar, viv&ecirc;ncia em gest&atilde;o de carteira de processos e autonomia na condu&ccedil;&atilde;o de casos, boa reda&ccedil;&atilde;o jur&iacute;dica e capacidade de an&aacute;lise cr&iacute;tica e disponibilidade para audi&ecirc;ncias e reuni&otilde;es externas.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Principais responsabilidades:</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Atua&ccedil;&atilde;o em processos judiciais c&iacute;veis envolvendo operadoras de plano de sa&uacute;de.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Elabora&ccedil;&atilde;o de pe&ccedil;as processuais (iniciais, contesta&ccedil;&otilde;es, recursos, manifesta&ccedil;&otilde;es diversas, memoriais etc.).</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">An&aacute;lise de a&ccedil;&otilde;es judiciais relacionadas a negativa de cobertura, fornecimento de medicamentos, procedimentos m&eacute;dicos e indeniza&ccedil;&otilde;es.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Atendimento a clientes e acompanhamento processual, prestando esclarecimentos t&eacute;cnicos e estrat&eacute;gicos.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Controle de prazos processuais e gest&atilde;o de publica&ccedil;&otilde;es.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Realiza&ccedil;&atilde;o de audi&ecirc;ncias e sustenta&ccedil;&otilde;es orais, quando necess&aacute;rio.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Elabora&ccedil;&atilde;o de relat&oacute;rios jur&iacute;dicos e pareceres para clientes internos e externos.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Apoio ao time estrat&eacute;gico na defini&ccedil;&atilde;o de teses jur&iacute;dicas e medidas preventivas.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Acompanhamento de jurisprud&ecirc;ncia e legisla&ccedil;&atilde;o voltada ao direito da sa&uacute;de.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Requisitos:</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Gradua&ccedil;&atilde;o completa em Direito;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">OAB ativa e regular.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Experi&ecirc;ncia em Sa&uacute;de Suplementar, Contencioso c&iacute;vel (planos de sa&uacute;de);</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Experi&ecirc;ncia em an&aacute;lise de risco processual, relat&oacute;rios gerenciais e estrat&eacute;gias jur&iacute;dicas;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Habilidades Desej&aacute;veis:</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Gest&atilde;o aut&ocirc;noma de processos e cumprimento de prazos com organiza&ccedil;&atilde;o e efici&ecirc;ncia;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Reda&ccedil;&atilde;o jur&iacute;dica clara e objetiva, com boa argumenta&ccedil;&atilde;o t&eacute;cnica;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Capacidade anal&iacute;tica para avalia&ccedil;&atilde;o de risco processual e elabora&ccedil;&atilde;o de estrat&eacute;gias jur&iacute;dicas;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Tomada de decis&atilde;o segura em situa&ccedil;&otilde;es de complexidade e urg&ecirc;ncia;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Boa comunica&ccedil;&atilde;o interpessoal, com facilidade para se relacionar com clientes, pares e gestores;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Proatividade e iniciativa na resolu&ccedil;&atilde;o de problemas;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Trabalho em equipe, colaborando com colegas e &aacute;reas correlatas;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Gest&atilde;o do tempo e prioridades, garantindo efici&ecirc;ncia em m&uacute;ltiplas demandas simult&acirc;neas;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Vis&atilde;o estrat&eacute;gica voltada para resultados e alinhamento aos objetivos do cliente e do escrit&oacute;rio.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Diferenciais:</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">Atua&ccedil;&atilde;o em interface com contencioso c&iacute;vel, com foco em sa&uacute;de suplementar.</span></p>",
